{"content":[{"c":["AKRABBIM*"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["A mountain pass or slope in southern Palestine between the southwestern tip of the Dead Sea and the wilderness of Zin. The pass (",{"href":"?bref=Num.34.4","r":"Num.34.4","rawR":"Num.34.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.34.4","value":"Num.34.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 34:4"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.1.36","r":"Judg.1.36","rawR":"Judg.1.36","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.1.36","value":"Judg.1.36"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jgs 1:36"},") of Mt Akrabbim served as part of the southern border of the land given to Judah’s tribe after the conquest of Canaan (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.15.3","r":"Josh.15.3","rawR":"Josh.15.3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.15.3","value":"Josh.15.3"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 15:3"},"; ",{"c":["kjv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"}," “Maaleh-acrabbim”). During the intertestamental period, Judas Maccabeus won an important victory over the Idumeans at this pass (",{"href":"?bref=1Macc.5.3","r":"1Macc.5.3","rawR":"1Macc.5.3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Macc.5.3","value":"1Macc.5.3"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Macc 5:3"},"). Also called Scorpion Pass."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Akrabbim","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Nm 34:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.34.4","rawQueryValue":"Num.34.4","sourceRefExact":"Num.34.4"},{"anchorText":"Jgs 1:36","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.1.36","rawQueryValue":"Judg.1.36","sourceRefExact":"Judg.1.36"},{"anchorText":"Jos 15:3","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.15.3","rawQueryValue":"Josh.15.3","sourceRefExact":"Josh.15.3"},{"anchorText":"1 Macc 5:3","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Macc.5.3","rawQueryValue":"1Macc.5.3","sourceRefExact":"1Macc.5.3"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"21dbbb22f83577152c3688b396680de7493d4dae3877e90c8a442d7ab4cc8009","sourceItemName":"Akrabbim","sourceItemOrder":230,"sourceMember":"Articles/A.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Akrabbim","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Akrabbim*","title":"Akrabbim*","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}